## 4. 데이터 모델 설계 (Supabase Schema Expert Ver.)

### 4.1 ERD & Relations
```mermaid
erDiagram
    STUDENTS ||--o{ ACADEMIC_RECORDS : has
    STUDENTS }|--|| MAJORS : wishes
    UNIVERSITIES ||--|{ DEPARTMENTS : contains
    DEPARTMENTS ||--o{ REQUIRED_SUBJECTS : requires
    REQUIRED_SUBJECTS }|--|| SUBJECTS : maps_to
    
    PROMPT_TEMPLATES ||--o{ PROMPT_LOGS : generates
    STUDENTS ||--o{ PROMPT_LOGS : requested_by

    STUDENTS {
        uuid id PK
        string name
        float gpa
        jsonb specs "세특 keywords"
    }
    
    SUBJECTS {
        uuid id PK
        string name
        boolean is_common "공통과목 여부"
    }

    PROMPT_LOGS {
        uuid id PK
        uuid prompt_id FK
        text input_variables
        text generated_result
        int tokens_used
        timestamp created_at
    }
```

### 4.2 Security Policies (RLS)
- **Admin**: 모든 테이블 `SELECT`, `INSERT`, `UPDATE`, `DELETE` 가능
- **User (Guest)**: 
    - `Universities`, `Departments`, `Subjects`: `SELECT` Only (Public)
    - `Students`, `Prompt_Logs`: 본인 소유 데이터만 접근 가능 (Session ID 기반)

